{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04268","headline":"过故宋 · 骆宾王","name":"过故宋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧国千年尽，荒城四望通。\n云浮非隐帝，日举类游童。\n绮琴朝化洽，祥石夜论空。\n马去遥奔郑，蛇分近带丰。\n池文敛束水，竹影漏寒丛。\n园兔承行月，川禽避断风。\n故宋诚难定，从梁事未工。\n唯当过周客，独愧吴台空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}